            "tag": "Sample",
            "role": "Read the ebook"
          }
        },
        "review_2": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "The chapter on notes changed how I read. One page per book, and I can tell you what every one of them was about.",
            "name": "Omar Siddiqui",
            "tag": "Sample",
            "role": "Listened to the audiobook"
          }
        },
        "review_3": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "Short, practical and kind. No reading challenge guilt, just a habit that fits in a lunch break.",
            "name": "Julia Brandt",
            "tag": "Sample",
            "role": "Bought the complete set"
          }
        },
        "review_4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "I gave it to my book club and now we all keep the same notes page. Our meetings are better for it.",
            "name": "Marcus Lee",
            "tag": "Sample",
            "role": "Read the ebook"
          }
        },
        "review_5": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "I quit three books I was dragging through and read five I loved instead. Permission to stop was the best part.",
